# Canonical author identity for this repo.
# Re-attributes commits made under other identities to the project owner, so
# `git log`/`git shortlog`/`git blame` and GitHub's contributor display all show
# a single identity — without rewriting history.
#
# Format: Canonical Name <canonical@email> <other@email>
